# Build context is the repo root; send only what the images need.
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/screenshots
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
backend/data
prototype
docs
*.md
!backend/**/*.md
main.py
# Not needed in any image: tests, the tax-data build tools, local env files, CI and compose files.
backend/tests
backend/tools
**/.env
**/.env.*
.github
compose*.yaml
